{"articleNo":"392083","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=392083&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 수강신청 가능여부 조회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.08.09","hit":"8211","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움;\">수강신청 가능여부 조회 화면을 아래와 같이 안내드리오니 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: left;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">▷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 가능여부 조회 기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:<b> <span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192); color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">8</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">. 9(화) ~&nbsp;</span></b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255); background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">8. 15.</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192); color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255); background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255); background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255); background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">까지</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">▷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">접속경로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">원스톱서비스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학부생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">학사관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">→</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">수강신청가능여부조회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">▷</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 수강신청 가능여부 조회화면은 학년별 수강신청을 확인하기 위함, 타학년 재수강과목 이수는 전체학년 수강신청기간을 이용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 가능여부는 </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">재수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">이중수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">선수과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">수강지도상담승인여부 등을 확인 할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">수강꾸러미 확정 후 수강꾸러미 신청내역 반영하여 수강신청 가능여부 확인 가능</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(8.11.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;\">오후부터)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">재수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">선수과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">이중수강과목 등 수강가능 여부가 이상이 있을 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">교무과로 문의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">(kny0915@kumoh.ac.kr, 054-478-7029)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">▷</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">수강신청 가능여부 조회화면</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움;